+'Home is a plausible transition after Added to cart.',
+'Crosshair hits Install for Google Fit.',
+'Browser search field is focused; family movies matches the goal.',
+'Home is a plausible transition out of the empty memo screen; whole-goal success is not asserted.',
+'Crosshair hits the message send arrow.',
+'Down is plausible to reach the forecast below; source endpoints checked, interactive map behavior not replayed.',
+'Home is a plausible transition after Added to Cart.',
+],
+'amex':[
